    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698020/extras/b9f1d3c230798fe16211ef450bccbea9.poster.avif?t=1694056660\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698020/extras/b9f1d3c230798fe16211ef450bccbea9.webm?t=1694056660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698020/extras/b9f1d3c230798fe16211ef450bccbea9.mp4?t=1694056660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>&quot;Best Puzzle game of 2022&quot;  \u2014\u2014 Ben plays VR<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Reflection is a <strong> VR puzzle adventure game</strong> with a traditional Chinese ring to it. </h2><br>The puzzle is innovative and unique. Players will challenge a multi-dimensional space created by the mirror, and use mirrors to solve puzzles by manipulating the world in mirror and entering it.  With access to seven themed chapters, players are to crack seven types of puzzles deriving from the mirrors, including Logic, Physics, Space, Time and so on.<br>Players can enjoy an immersive tour in the landscape, experiencing calligraphically tranquil landscapes in vastly expansive paint-like scenarios while solving puzzles.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key features:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Challenge yourself with varied puzzles derivatived by one simple rule, change mirrror wold and enter the mirror. Enjoy yourself with the elegant and concise of thinking for hours.</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698020/extras/ff44d682a219121a651ff29ac8bf42bc.avif?t=1694056660\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>As you progress on seven chapters,  feast your eyes on the &quot;Grand Sight Garden&quot;, set foot on the most famous imaginary garden of China.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Tracing back to the fifth chapter in Dream of the Red Chamber, the game draws inspiration from Jia Baoyu\u2019s visit to The land of Faery. You will be guid to a sad story metaphor hinted by the puzzles, experience the combination of the karmic wheel of cause and effect, birth and rebirth.</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Original stylized music combining electronic music and ancient chinese style.</li></ul></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698020/extras/b9f1d3c230798fe16211ef450bccbea9.poster.avif?t=1694056660\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698020/extras/b9f1d3c230798fe16211ef450bccbea9.webm?t=1694056660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698020/extras/b9f1d3c230798fe16211ef450bccbea9.mp4?t=1694056660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>&quot;Best Puzzle game of 2022&quot;  \u2014\u2014 Ben plays VR<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Reflection is a <strong> VR puzzle adventure game</strong> with a traditional Chinese ring to it. </h2><br>The puzzle is innovative and unique. Players will challenge a multi-dimensional space created by the mirror, and use mirrors to solve puzzles by manipulating the world in mirror and entering it.  With access to seven themed chapters, players are to crack seven types of puzzles deriving from the mirrors, including Logic, Physics, Space, Time and so on.<br>Players can enjoy an immersive tour in the landscape, experiencing calligraphically tranquil landscapes in vastly expansive paint-like scenarios while solving puzzles.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key features:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Challenge yourself with varied puzzles derivatived by one simple rule, change mirrror wold and enter the mirror. Enjoy yourself with the elegant and concise of thinking for hours.</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698020/extras/ff44d682a219121a651ff29ac8bf42bc.avif?t=1694056660\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>As you progress on seven chapters,  feast your eyes on the &quot;Grand Sight Garden&quot;, set foot on the most famous imaginary garden of China.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Tracing back to the fifth chapter in Dream of the Red Chamber, the game draws inspiration from Jia Baoyu\u2019s visit to The land of Faery. You will be guid to a sad story metaphor hinted by the puzzles, experience the combination of the karmic wheel of cause and effect, birth and rebirth.</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Original stylized music combining electronic music and ancient chinese style.</li></ul></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Reflection is a Chinese VR puzzle game. The puzzle is innovative and unique. Players will challenge a multi-dimensional space created by the mirror, and use mirrors to solve puzzles by manipulating the world in mirror and enter it. Puzzles including Logic, Physics, Space, Time and so on.",
